<BaseLayout title="About — Alexander Mervar" description="About Alexander Mervar — essays and film criticism.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <figure class="about-photo">
    <img src="/images/about.jpg" alt="Alexander Mervar, outdoors on a sunny day" />
  </figure>

  <p>Hello! I'm Alexander — welcome to my little corner of the internet.</p>

  <p>This site is my personal blog and publishing space. Expect the occasional new project or post, and feel free to <a href="/rss.xml">subscribe via RSS</a>.</p>

  <p>I studied <a href="https://cogs.indiana.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cognitive Science</a> at Indiana University with a focus on computation, which gave me early exposure to AI systems — LLMs, agent-based models, the works — back when that was a niche academic pursuit rather than the topic of every tech headline. It was all aimed at understanding how minds work, which is still the thread running through most of what I find interesting.</p>

  <p>By day I'm a technology consultant. Outside of work you'll find me reading literary fiction, watching films (I log everything on <a href="https://letterboxd.com/macDoofOS/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Letterboxd</a>), tinkering on <a href="https://github.com/alexandermervar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">home lab and side projects</a>, or slowly getting better at chess.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>

  <p>Email is best — <span class="email-display">hello&#32;&#91;at&#93;&#32;alexandermervar&#32;&#91;dot&#93;&#32;com</span> — or find me on <a href="https://hachyderm.io/@macDoofOS" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Mastodon</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .email-display {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

